---
code: cli-unknown-mode
when-fires: the leading token is not a mode but is within edit-distance 2 of one. cli/lib.rs parse_args_from. {mode} is the token, {suggestion} the nearest real mode.
why: 27S did-you-mean: a near-miss is a typo, and naming the intended mode costs one line and saves a round-trip. A wholly-different word is a positional book instead, never a wrong guess.
---
-- replay --
$ dorc pln --book=webhost.sh
error[cli-unknown-mode]: [unwritten: cli-unknown-mode]
